# Remember a choice
@scenario office_lesson_07
@include /definitions/characters.vns
@label start
[mode dialogue standard]
[set ui.dialogueUi project]
[bg office]
[char pip global on]
[set ui.dialogueFadeMs 160]
[stage clear]
[show pip desk notes]
pip: I marked this desk as ready. Watch what the game does with that flag.
[flag desk_ready]
[if desk_ready]
pip: The status light is on. We can begin.
[endif]
pip: Change the flag test to its opposite. Run the cue again and compare the response.
@label check
pip: What keeps a switch position between dialogue lines?
> A story variable. -> correct
> A label name. -> retry
@label retry
[show pip desk curious]
pip: The flag writes state and the condition reads it. Give it another try.
[jump check]
@label correct
[show pip desk cheer]
pip: The flag writes state and the condition reads it.
> Finish this lesson -> return_hub
> Try the lesson again -> start
@label return_hub
[if !tutorial_done_07]
[flag tutorial_done_07]
[inc tutorial_count]
[endif]
[stage clear]
[goto TutorialHub:topics_page_2]
